# ── OS / editor ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*~
#*#

# ── Simulation and plotting output ─────────────────────────────────────
*.nc
*.jld2
*.png
*.gif
*.fig
*.mp4

# ── HPC run directories ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# On Casper the working tree IS /glade/work/nguyen/unc-shoals, so these
# output directories sit inside the repo. Listed explicitly (not just by
# file extension) so that logs, .out/.err files and stray artifacts inside
# them stay untracked too.
/nc/
/nc_old/
/out/
/output/
/logs/
/checkpoints/
/sweep_output/
/archive/
/figures/
# /pbs/ holds PBS run artifacts on Casper, and is the natural home for
# personal qsub wrappers now that *.pbs is ignored everywhere.
/pbs/
/wind_0p*/
/wind_m0p*/
/*_NOWIND_SAVE/
*.o[0-9]*
*.e[0-9]*

# ── Third-party MATLAB toolboxes ───────────────────────────────────────
# Installed on Casper under tools/, deliberately not vendored into git.
# A clone anywhere else needs these fetched separately.
/tools/gsw_matlab_v3_06_16/
/tools/cmocean/
/tools/pmkmp/

# =====================================================================
# PBS job scripts: IGNORED, by request (Nov 2026). How to submit now lives
# on Casper only.
#
# *.sh is still tracked -- tools/run_*.sh are the MATLAB launchers and they
# must travel with the repo.
#
# The trade-off, recorded because it bit before: blanket-ignoring these is
# exactly why src/sweep/submit_wind_fork.pbs and submit_wind_sweep.pbs went
# uncommitted for months while submit_sweep.pbs sat tracked beside them.
# From here, a NEW submit script written on a laptop will not reach Casper
# by `git pull` -- it has to be copied there by hand.
#
# The six that were tracked are preserved at commit 113f745. To restore them
# on any machine:
#
#   for f in geomcontrol res250 sweep weakwind wind_fork wind_sweep; do
#       git show 113f745:src/sweep/submit_$f.pbs > src/sweep/submit_$f.pbs
#   done
#   chmod +x src/sweep/*.pbs
#
# If propagation turns out to matter more than local edits, the way back is
# to track submit_*.pbs.template and keep the live .pbs ignored.
# =====================================================================
*.pbs
